{"id":"vod_bf_15958","vodId":"15958","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达SEED HD重制","name_cn":"机动战士高达SEED HD重制","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/db366de811628da518537731b731b7c5.jpg"},"summary":"為迎接機動戰士鋼彈SEED十周年的2012年，官方於2011年8月26日啟動「HD Remaster Project（高畫質再製企劃）」，畫面尺寸比將從原先的4：3升級為16：9寬螢幕，線性PCM音源化，部分音樂採用混音版，局部畫面的替換和修正，各特效與背景的處理變更，並整合特別版三部作以及「DESTINY」的賽璐珞片，再編輯為全48話，收錄至Blu-ray共四卷BOX販售。相較於過去其他鋼彈作品的Remaster僅是單純的高畫質化，本作有著更全面的提升。「機動戰士鋼彈SEED HD」於2011年12月23日起在BandaiChannel針對日本國內進行限定放送，TV方面則於2012年1月1日起在日本BS11播映。gundam.info同時提供附有簡體中文(已不再提供)、繁體中文、英文和韓文字幕影片的網路配信。愛奇藝將本作命名為「機動戰士高達SEED HD Remaster」於2011年12月23日11時起播出。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:13:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodaSEEDHDzhongzhi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1